indicators.title:
Number of measures implemented with UN's support to:
a) Eliminate gender-based discrimination and segregation in the labour market;
b) Increase women’s access to and use of digital technologies, digital finance, e-commerce  and digital value chains
c) Ensure women’s economic security and empowerment; 
d) Address discriminatory gender and social norms, stereotypes and practices; and
e) Promote the recognition, reduction, and redistribution of unpaid care and domestic work

